      "message": "Merge current upstream main into fixpoint-staged\n\nPreserve main c210f226346b462214866b5756b457ad53f647b1 with stage flags off.\nCarry receiver-side parameter keys through S3 worklist rows, handoffs and\nrecursive slots, sharing main's call-site resolution and lawful joins.\nJoin parameter observations before bounding each row, including worklist\nsite, concern and overlay folds. Keep main's S0 observer fixes and add the\nstaged fold, provenance and worklist observations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
